kill-based Matchmaking</strong> ensures that you'll be matched against the right opponents every game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686820/extras/fb41129fb1e5a09ff81ed940bb628b59.poster.avif?t=1640702754\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686820/extras/fb41129fb1e5a09ff81ed940bb628b59.webm?t=1640702754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div> ASCENSION GAME MODE</h2><i>To the victor go the spoils!</i> Consecutive victories increases your group's <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686820/extras/ad220444a0e34b4b325588d140f4f5b4.webp?t=1640702754\" /></div> <strong>Bounty Value</strong>, advancing your party closer towards <strong>King's Ascent</strong>, a <i>Continuous Global Tournament Event</i> reserved for the two most dominant teams. Winning Ascension rewards <strong>epic treasure</strong> and a <strong>global shoutout</strong> heard across the Arena of Kings universe.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686820/extras/edafb626ae4fde36dbd66ca75dd8bf0b.poster.avif?t=1640702754\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686820/extras/edafb626ae4fde36dbd66ca75dd8bf0b.webm?t=1640702754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686820/extras/edafb626ae4fde36dbd66ca75dd8bf0b.mp4?t=1640702754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st